<view class="login">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-mark">宠</view>
    <view class="brand">宠爱有家</view>
    <view class="slogan">宠物洗护 · 美容 · 寄养 · 上门服务预约</view>
  </view>

  <view class="login-card">
    <view class="card-title">欢迎回来</view>
    <view class="card-sub">登录后可预约服务、管理宠物档案、参与社区互动</view>

    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block login-btn" bindtap="wxLogin" loading="{{wxLoading}}" disabled="{{logging}}">
      微信一键登录
    </button>

    <view class="or">
      <view class="line"></view>
      <text class="or-text">或使用邮箱验证码</text>
      <view class="line"></view>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <input
        class="field-input"
        type="text"
        maxlength="64"
        placeholder="请输入邮箱"
        placeholder-class="form-placeholder"
        value="{{email}}"
        bindinput="onEmailInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="code-row">
      <input
        class="field-input code-input"
        type="number"
        maxlength="6"
        placeholder="6位验证码"
        placeholder-class="form-placeholder"
        value="{{code}}"
        bindinput="onCodeInput"
      />
      <button
        class="btn btn-light btn-sm code-btn"
        bindtap="sendCode"
        loading="{{sending}}"
        disabled="{{sending || countdown > 0}}"
      >
        {{countdown > 0 ? countdown + 's 后重发' : '发送验证码'}}
      </button>
    </view>

    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block login-btn" bindtap="emailLogin" loading="{{logging}}" disabled="{{wxLoading}}">
      登录
    </button>

    <view class="hint">
      验证码 5 分钟内有效，1 分钟内只能发送一次；连续发送或输错次数过多会触发临时限制。微信登录需要小程序 appid 与后端 pet.wechat 配置一致。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>